OL,3,ATrainline, Virgin Atlantic and RED
OL,4,ADriving School investigated over 'drip
OL,5,Apricing'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIf the CMA concludes that the firms
OL,8,Fhave broken the law, it can fine them
OL,9,For order them to compensate customers.
OL,11,FThe three companies said they were
OL,12,Fcommitted to transparency for customers
OL,13,Fand would engage fully with the CMA.
